id: tz_secure_execution
label: TrustZone Secure Execution
description: >
  This component prevents the Non-Secure execution startup  from being executed. However, to ensure compatibility and  seamless integration with prebuilt libraries like Rail,  the Non-Secure execution should be used instead.

  Note: This component is intended only for TrustZone-unaware  applications. It is not a template or framework for building  either Secure or Non-Secure applications. For those use cases,  please use the `trustzone_secure` and `trustzone_nonsecure`  components.
package: platform_core
category: Platform|TrustZone
quality: production
root_path: platform_core/platform/common
provides:
- name: tz_secure_execution
- name: tz_execution
requires:
- name: device_series_3
- name: trustzone_unaware
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: Zlib
